WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.668
Meet ID Ready. A simple way to turn your photo into an ID picture, or a sheet ready to print.

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:17.356
Take a photo with your camera, or upload one from your device. Keep your head and shoulders visible, with even lighting.

00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:28.109
Remove the background on your device. Adjust the crop, zoom, and lighting. Add an optional border or digital name tag.

00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:40.497
Choose your photo size, paper, and copy count. Download a PDF, then print at actual size, one hundred percent, with fit to page turned off.

00:00:41.697 --> 00:00:52.505
For offline use, open the app online and download the required assets. After setup, your photos stay on your device, with no account needed.

00:00:53.705 --> 00:01:05.648
ID Ready. Your photo, print ready. Follow the receiving agency's requirements. A digital name tag does not replace a required physical name tag.
